('3', 'hatemosphere/terraform-provider-hcloudplus#18', 'hatemosphere/terraform-provider-hcloudplus', 'Issue', 'Firewall rules drift after import', 'https://github.com/hatemosphere/terraform-provider-hcloudplus/issues/18', 'comment', strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now', '-2 hours'), 1, 1, 0, 'open', '@mirela-t: same on 1.4.2, minimal repro attached. Looks like the import keeps the rule order from the API but the plan sorts them, so every apply shows a diff'),
